{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S09、S11等较短停留段里，部分感受句需要读完整才能理解，不如X的短词一眼扫过来得直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把叙事重心突出，普通观众即使没有时间读完所有感受，也能抓住每段发生了什么；感受又随着音乐进程出现，能看见情绪如何从想念、不甘、孤单逐步走向接受和继续生活。尤其Y的感受不只是给情绪贴标签，还把声音、动作、身体反应和心理变化联系起来，细腻程度明显胜过X。X的优势是短词便于快速扫读，但像S03这样把大量情绪和感受并列摆放，容易让人知道情绪很多，却不容易感受到它们之间的先后、转折和因果。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "36f7c543-289b-4034-93e8-1235f097500b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T041911649655Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:20:05.599844+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3dae42dde6dca3f3170a8d12429bdb2a196e12b287c7c85b4084971030b1be98", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch